			</svg></a></li></ul></li><li class="menu-item has-submenu menu-item-has-children"><button type="button" class="tosa-mobile-trigger" data-label="Get Involved">Get Involved<svg class="tosa-mobile-trigger-icon tosa-mobile-trigger-icon--arrow" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="11" viewBox="0 0 14 11" fill="none"><path d="M13.6271 4.78618C11.0762 4.78618 8.99893 2.79818 8.99893 0.356911V0H7.50719V0.356911C7.50719 2.07365 8.30155 3.68689 9.63665 4.78975H0V6.21739H9.62547C8.29409 7.32025 7.50346 8.93349 7.50346 10.6431V11H8.9952V10.6431C8.9952 8.20182 11.0725 6.21382 13.6233 6.21382H13.9963V4.78618H13.6233H13.6271Z" fill="#5DBACA"/></svg></button><ul class="sub-menu"><li class="menu-item menu-item-3150" data-id="3150"><a href="https://wauwatosa.gov/get-involved/community-organizations/">Community Organizations</a></li><li class="menu-item menu-item-9524" data-id="9524"><a href="https://wauwatosa.gov/get-involved/distinguished-citizen-award/">Distinguished Citizen Award</a></li><li class="menu-item menu-item-3151" data-id="3151"><a href="https://wauwatosa.gov/get-involved/neighborhood-associations/">Neighborhood Associations</a></li><li class="menu-item menu-item-9528 menu-item-has-children has-submenu" data-id="9528"><button type="button" class="tosa-mobile-trigger" data-label="Volunteer">Volunteer<svg class="tosa-mobile-trigger-icon" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none"><path d="M1 1L6.49999 7L12 1" stroke="#D9D9D9" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M1 1L6.49999 7L12 1" stroke="#1C3866" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></button><ul class="sub-menu" data-depth="0"><li class="menu-item menu-item-3189" data-id="3189"><a href="https://wauwatosa.gov/departments/city-clerk/elections-voting/poll-worker/">As A Poll Worker</a></li><li class="menu-item menu-item-1344" data-id="1344"><a href="https://wauwatosalibrary.org/about-the-li