									<div class="dept-hero-overlap-card__content">
						<p>The City Clerk administers elections and voting in the City of Wauwatosa, and is charged with ensuring the electoral process is fair, accurate, impartial, and conducted in accordance with the laws of the State of Wisconsin.</p>
