            </div>
                            <div class="mt-4">
                <p>There may also be special elections to fill vacancies, such as in the event of an early retirement. <a href="https://wauwatosa.gov/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/2026-Aldermanic-District-Ma.pdf">View the Aldermanic District Map</a>.</p>
            </div>
        
